  m_text: "By signing below, the undersigned (\u201CCustomer\u201D) agrees to enroll
    in the Premium Deluxe Maximum Protection Insurance Plan, hereafter referred to
    as \u201CThe Plan.\u201D\n\nThe Plan may or may not provide coverage for the
    following incidents:\n\n\u2022 Unexpected cup movement\n\u2022 Ball-related disappearance\n\u2022
    Incorrect cup selection\n\u2022 Sudden financial, emotional, or spiritual distress
    caused by choosing the wrong cup\n\u2022 Shuffle-related confusion\n\u2022 Catastrophic
    cup events\n\u2022 Acts of God, acts of cups, or acts involving cups that may
    reasonably be mistaken for acts of God\n\u2022 Boss fights, suspicious salesmen,
    and other foreseeable workplace hazards\n\nCoverage is subject to all terms,
    exclusions, conditions, exceptions, exceptions to the exceptions, and several
    paragraphs that nobody reads.\n\nThe Customer acknowledges that insurance does
    not guarantee victory, happiness, financial security, or the ability to correctly
    identify which cup contains the ball.\n\nMonthly premium: $49.99\n\nAdministrative
    fee: $12.00\n\nProcessing fee: $8.50\n\nConvenience fee: $16.00\n\nFee explanation
    fee: $3.99\n\nBy signing this agreement, the Customer confirms that they have
    voluntarily entered into this legally questionable relationship and agree not
    to ask too many questions."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
